cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pipnick: Photometric Pipeline for the Nickel Telescope"
abstract: >-
  A Python pipeline for basic image processing and photometric analysis of
  imaging data obtained with the 1-meter Nickel Telescope at Lick Observatory.
  Originally developed for an Akamai 2024 internship project.
type: software
authors:
